  The caption says the protest took place 'இன்று' (today) and the reel_script states the protest was held, but the caption's 'இன்று' relies on the posting date rather than the article; this is a temporal claim not supported by the article.
  The reel_script says 'கைகளில் தராசை ஏந்தியும்' and the caption says 'நூதன முறையில்' – consistent; however the reel_script's opening line 'கண்ணில் கருப்பு துணி கட்டி போராட்டம்' omits that the protesters did this collectively as their method, which is acceptable.
